abstract: >
  A machine learning framework for calibrating PurpleAir temperature
  sensors using a single national XGBoost model with temporal features.
  The released 63-feature model achieves mean absolute error of 0.78°C and
  R-squared of 0.987 on the held-out test set. The study includes 797,744
  hourly observations from 31 U.S. states.
